          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: احتیاط",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "احتیاط (ehtiyât) — \"caution, care\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او با احتیاط از پله ها پایین رفت. u bâ ehtiyât az pelle hâ pâyin raft. He went down the stairs with care."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bâ ehtiyât — carefully. Ehtiyât kardan — to be careful."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "احتیاط (ehtiyât) is usually traced to Arabic iḥtiyāṭ \"caution, precaution\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
