              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "محض احتیاط یک چتر برداشتم. mahz-e ehtiyât yek chatr bardâshtam. I took an umbrella in case."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mahz \"pure\" + ehtiyât \"caution\": purely for caution."
            }
          ]
        },
