              "text": "پیش آمدن (pish âmadan) — \"to come up, to crop up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "یک مشکل کوچک پیش آمد. yek moshkel-e kuchek pish âmad. A small problem came up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pish \"forward\" + âmadan \"to come\" (present stem â-)."
